<newsitem itemid="106013" id="root" date="1996-10-09" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Munchen Hypo sets 100 mln mark 5-year step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Munchen Hypo sets 100 mln mark 5-year step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUNCHEN HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY    30.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING    MUNICH    DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR YEAR ONE, RISING TO 4.5 PERCENT IN YEAR TWO,</p>
<p>		5.0 PERCENT IN YEAR THREE, 6.0 PERCENT IN YEAR FOUR</p>
<p>		AND 6.5 PERCENT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		CALLABLE ON 30.OCT.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
